Package: usl.gplus.bot
Title: USL Super League Goals Added (g+) and xG Leaders Bluesky Bot
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Watches American Soccer Analysis's Bluesky account for their
    NWSL Goals Added (g+) and xG leaders post as a timing signal, then
    independently builds and posts the USL Super League equivalent using
    itscalledsoccer data.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    atrrr,
    itscalledsoccer,
    gt,
    webshot2,
    duckdb,
    DBI,
    dotenv,
    glue
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    magick
Config/testthat/edition: 3
